(README CONTENT) Tj
T*
(# OpenPulse 脉动) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI-powered autonomous news-to-video generation pipeline. This system transforms real-time news ) Tj
T*
(feeds into cinematic vertical short-form videos using an orchestrated pipeline of LLMs, GSAP ) Tj
T*
(animations, and HyperFrames rendering.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 🚀 Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.  **Ingestion**: Scrapes Hacker News \(and other sources\) for trending stories.) Tj
T*
(2.  **Inference**: Uses vLLM or LM Studio \(Local\) to generate a HyperFrames-compatible HTML ) Tj
T*
(composition.) Tj
T*
(3.  **Composition**: Dynamically builds a GSAP-powered animation sequence.) Tj
T*
(4.  **Rendering**: Uses Headless Chromium via Playwright to capture frames.) Tj
T*
(5.  **Encoding**: FFMPEG compiles frames into a production-ready MP4.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 🛠️ Tech Stack) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(-   **Backend**: Node.js, Fastify, TypeScript) Tj
T*
(-   **Frontend**: React, TailwindCSS, Lucide-React, Motion) Tj
T*
(-   **Inference**: **vLLM** \(Production-grade\), LM Studio \(Local / Mesh\)) Tj
T*
(-   **Rendering**: [HeyGen HyperFrames]\(https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes\)) Tj
T*
(-   **Animation**: GSAP \(GreenSock\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 📦 Setup & Installation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 1. vLLM \(Recommended for Production\)) Tj
T*
(1.  Install vLLM following the [official guide]\(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm\).) Tj
T*
(2.  Run the server:) Tj
T*
(    ```bash) Tj
T*
(    python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server --model Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct --port 8000) Tj
T*
(    ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 2. Application Setup) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(# Install dependencies) Tj
T*
(npm install) Tj
T*
() Tj
