(## 🎥 HyperFrames Integration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OpenPulse treats HTML/JS as executable video code. ) Tj
T*
(- **Deterministic**: Every frame is calculated based on the GSAP timeline.) Tj
T*
(- **Clip-Safe**: Uses `data-start` and `data-duration` attributes for precise temporal ) Tj
T*
(alignment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 🛡️ Security) Tj
T*
(-   Encrypted mesh networking via Tailscale \(integrated via LM Link\).) Tj
T*
(-   Sandboxed rendering environment.) Tj
T*
(-   Environment-based secret management.) Tj
